In what sense are limsup/liminf jimte? They are not bounds for the entire
sequence (consider 1,0,0,0..., which has limsup 0), and are not necessarily
bounds for an infinite tail of the sequence either (consider any strictly
monotone sequence).

mu'o mi'e la latro'a

